---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="About Us – Shakarganj Foundation"
  description="Learn about Shakarganj Foundation's history, mission, education initiatives, healthcare dispensaries, and social welfare programs across Pakistan."
>
  <!-- Standard Top Page Hero Banner -->
  <section class="page_hero_banner">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero_breadcrumbs">
        <a href="/">Home</a> <span>›</span>
        <span>About Us</span> <span>›</span>
        <span class="current">Introduction</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="hero_page_title">About Us</h1>
      <p class="hero_subtitle">Empowering communities through education, healthcare, and socio-economic support across Pakistan for over two decades.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Content Area -->
  <section class="main-content-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-grid">
        <!-- Left Main Content Column -->
        <div class="main-column">
          
          <!-- Who Are We? -->
          <div class="content-block">
            <h2 class="block-title"><span class="highlight-gold">Who Are We?</span></h2>
            <p>
              Shakarganj Foundation was established two decades ago and is among the most well-known non-profit organizations in Pakistan today. Our organization promotes and provides education services, healthcare and studies in home economics as well as arts and crafts for the underprivileged cohort of Pakistani society. The scope of our work extends to the cities of Jhang and Bhone and the remote areas surrounding these cities in Pakistan’s Punjab province.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- What Are We Doing? -->
          <div class="content-block">
            <h2 class="block-title"><span class="highlight-gold">What Are We Doing?</span></h2>
            <p>
              Shakarganj Foundation has adopted 21 Government Girls Schools where we periodically implement infrastructure enhancements to ensure a more comfortable learning environment for our students. We also provide our students with a Nutrition Program through which we distribute milk and seasonal fruits to ensure a healthy and balanced diet. We also provide our students and staff with basic necessities such as adequate clothing, notebooks and stationary, comfortable furniture such as desks, chairs and tables and clean drinking water.
            </p>
            <p>
              Shakarganj Foundation’s Healthcare Arm consists of two Stationed Dispensaries and two Mobile Dispensaries. This setup caters not only to our employees and their families but to anyone living in the cities of Jhang and Bhone and their surrounding areas. Walk-ins are welcomed and examined by our highly qualified and trained doctors and nurses and are accorded medicines as per their diagnosis, <strong class="badge-free">ONE HUNDRED PERCENT FREE OF COST</strong>.
            </p>
            <p>
              Shakarganj Foundation’s Adult Literacy Program is modeled after the well known Jugno Sabaq and has a proven record of a positive social and economic impact on society. It equips adults with no previous educational history with the ability to read and write and also enables them with basic mathematical skills. To date a total of 3,250 adults have been benefited from Shakarganj Foundation’s Adult Literacy Program.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Our Values -->
          <div class="content-block values-block">
            <h3 class="sub-block-title">Our Values</h3>
            <div class="values-grid">
              <div class="value-item">
                <span class="value-bullet">✦</span> Honesty
              </div>
              <div class="value-item">
                <span class="value-bullet">✦</span> Sincerity
              </div>
              <div class="value-item">
                <span class="value-bullet">✦</span> Justice
              </div>
              <div class="value-item">
                <span class="value-bullet">✦</span> Commitment
              </div>
              <div class="value-item">
                <span class="value-bullet">✦</span> Empathy
              </div>
              <div class="value-item">
                <span class="value-bullet">✦</span> Ownership
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Right Sidebar Column -->
        <aside class="sidebar-column">
          
          <!-- At A Glance Card -->
          <div class="card glance-card">
            <div class="card-header">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M18 17V9"/><path d="M13 17V5"/><path d="M8 17v-3"/></svg>
              <h3>At A Glance</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
              <ul class="glance-list">
                <li><span class="label">Established:</span> <strong class="val">2000</strong></li>
                <li><span class="label">Excellence in Services:</span> <strong class="val">25+ Years</strong></li>
                <li><span class="label">Schools Adopted:</span> <strong class="val">21</strong></li>
                <li><span class="label">Dispensaries:</span> <strong class="val">6</strong></li>
                <li><span class="label">Art Gallery:</span> <strong class="val">1</strong></li>
                <li><span class="label">Students Benefited:</span> <strong class="val">5,000+</strong></li>
                <li><span class="label">Teachers Benefited:</span> <strong class="val">200+</strong></li>
                <li><span class="label">Patients Benefited:</span> <strong class="val">500,000+</strong></li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Registrations Card -->
          <div class="card reg-card">
            <div class="card-header">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"/></svg>
              <h3>Official Registrations</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
              <ul class="reg-list">
                <li>
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                  <span>Societies Registration Act 1860</span>
                </li>
                <li>
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                  <span>Punjab Charity Commission</span>
                </li>
                <li>
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                  <span>Federal Board of Revenue (FBR)</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Program Feature Cards Section -->
  <section class="program-cards-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2 class="section-title">Our Core Programs</h2>
        <div class="title-decorator"></div>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Dedicated divisions executing targeted social impact initiatives across education, health, and cultural preservation.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid-3">
        <!-- Education Card -->
        <div class="card program-card">
          <div class="card-img-wrapper">
            <img 
              src="https://docs.sf.org.pk/images/card_education.png" 
              alt="Education Program"
              loading="lazy"
              onerror="this.src='/images/card_education.png'"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <div class="program-icon-title">
              <span class="program-icon">📖</span>
              <h3>Education</h3>
            </div>
            <ul class="program-bullets">
              <li><strong>Adopted Schools</strong></li>
              <li><strong>Nutrition Program</strong></li>
              <li><strong>Adult Literacy Program</strong></li>
            </ul>
            <a href="/education/" class="read-more-btn">
              <span>READ MORE</span>
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Healthcare Card -->
        <div class="card program-card">
          <div class="card-img-wrapper">
            <img 
              src="https://docs.sf.org.pk/images/card_healthcare.jpg" 
              alt="Healthcare Program"
              loading="lazy"
              onerror="this.src='/images/card_healthcare.jpg'"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <div class="program-icon-title">
              <span class="program-icon">🏥</span>
              <h3>Healthcare</h3>
            </div>
            <ul class="program-bullets">
              <li><strong>Stationed Free Dispensaries</strong></li>
              <li><strong>Mobile Free Dispensaries</strong></li>
              <li><strong>Artificial Limbs</strong></li>
            </ul>
            <a href="/healthcare/" class="read-more-btn">
              <span>READ MORE</span>
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Jhang Art Gallery Card -->
        <div class="card program-card">
          <div class="card-img-wrapper">
            <img 
              src="https://docs.sf.org.pk/images/card_art.png" 
              alt="Jhang Art Gallery"
              loading="lazy"
              onerror="this.src='/images/card_art.png'"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <div class="program-icon-title">
              <span class="program-icon">🎨</span>
              <h3>Jhang Art Gallery</h3>
            </div>
            <ul class="program-bullets">
              <li><strong>Fine Arts</strong></li>
              <li><strong>Fashion Designing</strong></li>
            </ul>
            <a href="/jhang-art-gallery/" class="read-more-btn">
              <span>READ MORE</span>
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    /* Main Content Section */
    .main-content-section {
      padding: 50px 0 60px;
      background: var(--bg-white);
    }
    .about-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }
    .content-block {
      margin-bottom: 35px;
    }
    .block-title {
      font-size: 26px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      color: var(--primary-dark);
    }
    .highlight-gold {
      color: #ff9c1e;
    }
    .content-block p {
      font-size: 15.5px;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      text-align: justify;
    }
    .badge-free {
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      background: rgba(0, 77, 0, 0.08);
      padding: 2px 6px;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    /* Values Grid */
    .values-block {
      background: var(--bg-light);
      padding: 28px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--primary-color);
    }
    .sub-block-title {
      font-size: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      color: var(--primary-dark);
    }
    .values-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 14px 20px;
    }
    .value-item {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text-dark);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .value-bullet {
      color: var(--accent-gold);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    /* Sidebar Cards */
    .sidebar-column {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 25px;
    }
    .glance-card {
      border-top: 4px solid var(--primary-color);
      background: var(--bg-light);
    }
    .reg-card {
      border-top: 4px solid var(--accent-gold);
      background: var(--bg-light);
    }
    .card-header {
      padding: 18px 20px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      background: var(--bg-white);
    }
    .card-header h3 {
      font-size: 18px;
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      margin: 0;
    }
    .card-header svg {
      color: var(--primary-color);
    }
    .glance-list {
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .glance-list li {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding-bottom: 8px;
      border-bottom: 1px stroke var(--border-light);
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .glance-list li:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
      padding-bottom: 0;
    }
    .glance-list .label {
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }
    .glance-list .val {
      color: var(--primary-color);
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .reg-list {
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .reg-list li {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--text-dark);
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .reg-list svg {
      color: var(--primary-color);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    /* Program Feature Cards */
    .program-cards-section {
      padding: 60px 0 70px;
      background: var(--bg-light);
    }
    .section-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 45px;
    }
    .program-card {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      height: 100%;
      transition: var(--transition-fast);
    }
    .program-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-6px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    }
    .card-img-wrapper {
      height: 200px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #e2ece2;
    }
    .card-img-wrapper img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      transition: transform 0.4s ease;
    }
    .program-card:hover .card-img-wrapper img {
      transform: scale(1.05);
    }
    .program-icon-title {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
    .program-icon {
      font-size: 22px;
      background: rgba(0, 77, 0, 0.08);
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .program-icon-title h3 {
      font-size: 20px;
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      margin: 0;
    }
    .program-bullets {
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 6px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      flex-grow: 1;
    }
    .program-bullets li {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      position: relative;
      padding-left: 14px;
    }
    .program-bullets li::before {
      content: "•";
      color: var(--accent-gold);
      font-weight: bold;
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
    }
    .read-more-btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--primary-color);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      transition: var(--transition-fast);
    }
    .read-more-btn:hover {
      color: var(--accent-gold);
      gap: 10px;
    }

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 992px) {
      .about-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .values-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }
    }
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .values-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</Layout>
